  "alternateName": "Micro-litter composition, amount and spatial distribution below harmful levels in coastal and marine environment",
  "description": "The composition, amount and spatial distribution of micro-litter on the coastline, in the surface layer of the water column, and in seabed sediment, are at levels that do not cause harm to the coastal and marine environment.\nMember States shall establish threshold\nvalues for these levels through cooperation at Union level, taking into account regional or subregional specificities.",
